  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTP player: Doubled buffer for replay to avoid play stop caused by buffer underruns",
  "description": "Patch solves issue for case when QT reads audio faster than reads it from file.\nThe change looks strange because there is no way how to get buffer size before\nstarting the play. So code start the play, reads buffer and stop it. Then increases\nbuffer size and start play again.\nNote: You still can receive ALSA notifications like:\nALSA lib pcm.c:8545:(snd_pcm_recover) underrun occurred\nbut it do not stop audio replay.",
